# Vendored canonical skin/appearance contract pin.
#
# Rule: these files are byte copies from the `contracts` repository. A change to
# any vendored file MUST update its sha256 here, and the copy must be re-taken
# from the tag named below. Do not edit a vendored schema by hand.
#
# v0.11.0 expands the appearance host allowlist from the outer panel to the
# rectangle radii: surface.panel.radius, surface.panel.border-width,
# surface.card.radius, surface.control.radius and surface.cell.radius.
# surface.pill.radius stays explicit (a capsule is a skin identity), and no
# padding, gap, type, paint, colour, state, layout or non-panel border-width
# path is delegable. The three appearance schemas are the canonical set for
# this class: `appearance-manifest` (the v2 TOML/JSON manifest envelope with
# the optional root `host` policy), `appearance-json` (the resolved tokens.json
# document; mode and host values already applied) and `appearance-artifact`
# (appearance.json metadata). The generation manifest schema is vendored for
# contract-byte parity and records the same five delegated paths in its
# optional host snapshot; this class emits skin/appearance documents, not
# generations, and never writes an artifact path. The three frozen v1 skin
# schemas are vendored at the same tag for provenance; this class no longer
# emits v1 manifests. All lengths are unitless JSON numbers rendered as CSS px,
# letter-spacing renders as em and font-weight stays unitless.
